#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:5
#: d96797347e3645b09fb08c5c9bb6e7e0
msgid "Setting up flight modes with the CLI"
msgstr "使用 CLI 设置飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:7
#: 250a0a8c393341669bc8a0cc6712160a
msgid ""
"If you don't want to use the Mission Planner, you can set up your flight "
"modes using the CLI (command line interface)"
msgstr "如果您不想使用 Mission Planner，可以使用 CLI（命令行界面）设置飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:9
#: c61d282b63464491b05f022062471d3b
msgid "Connect your APM/PX to your computer using the mini USB cable"
msgstr "使用 mini USB 数据线将您的 APM/PX 连接到计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:10
#: 3b5cfc56c276483d99d797fc466dc59e
msgid ""
"Go to the Mission Planner's Terminal window and press the \"Connect to APM\""
" or \"Connect to PX4\" button"
msgstr "进入 Mission Planner 的终端窗口，点击「Connect to APM」或「Connect to PX4」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:12
#: e3acce9286634667b5957e534f5aca94
msgid "At the prompt type ***setup*** (and press enter)"
msgstr "在提示符下输入 ***setup***（然后按回车）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:13
#: e5bb9c07a5514a9f81bd6758947938af
msgid "Type \\ ***modes*** (and press enter)"
msgstr "输入 \\ ***modes***（然后按回车）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:14
#: 4aadb33f4e7a400d951b2888610a833d
msgid ""
"Move your transmitter's flight mode switch (channel 5) to the position you "
"want to assign and you should see the switches current flight mode be "
"displayed"
msgstr "拨动发射机的飞行模式开关（第 5 通道）到您想要指定的位置，您将看到该开关当前的飞行模式被显示出来。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:17
#: 5d493f02d3bb4dc3a7d2803a016df897
msgid ""
"Move your aileron (aka roll) stick left or right to cycle through the "
"various modes available."
msgstr "左右拨动副翼（即横滚）摇杆，循环切换各个可用模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:19
#: 1e963edd6d224aae91eb471c8646701d
msgid "Repeat for the other flight mode switch positions."
msgstr "对其他飞行模式开关位置重复以上操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:20
#: 4a3692933ef24e289212d4ba7fc0db94
msgid "When you are done, press Enter to save and exit."
msgstr "完成后，按回车键保存并退出。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-flight-modes-with-the-cli.rst:22
#: bff452a8f4cc49278132fceb009ab415
msgid ""
"Below is an example output when setting the flight mode switch's 2nd and 3rd"
" position to Alt Hold and Auto respectively"
msgstr "以下是将飞行模式开关第 2 和第 3 个位置分别设置为 Alt Hold 和 Auto 时的示例输出。"
